wip/tailcat: Add tailcat-0.5.0

Tailcat is netcat over Tailscale's data plane. It uses WireGuard tunnels with 
DERP for NAT traversal. No need for Tailscale's control plane: no account, no root,
no changes to the machine's routing or DNS.

NetBSD needs the bundled wireguard-go module patched in the module cache,
since its ipc package matches no NetBSD file and its tun package has no
tun_netbsd.go; see the comment in the Makefile.
